Package: cellprograms
Type: Package
Title: Cell-Type-Specific Transcriptional Programs via Empirical-Bayes Matrix Factorization
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mikhael Dito", "Manurung", email = "mikhael@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Discover cell-type-specific transcriptional programs from
    pseudobulk single-cell RNA-seq data using empirical-Bayes matrix
    factorization ('flashier'), with canonicalization, stability assessment,
    and tidy export. Programs are discovered locally within each cell type;
    cross-cell-type coordination is investigated subsequently, never assumed.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    Matrix,
    stats,
    utils,
    cli,
    rlang
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    ggplot2,
    data.table,
    flashier,
    ebnm
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
